{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's go fishing on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your rod at different locations, each with its own unique scenery and fish to catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Score Attack]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch lots of fish and earn points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the biggest fish to earn the biggest rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for rare creatures\u2014there's more than just fish in this river!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Ranking]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your skills by increasing your high score and rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Battle]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against CPUs in single-player mode, or test your skills against friends in multiplayer battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Records]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fish that you catch in Score Attack or Battle Mode will be recorded in your encyclopedia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hard to reel in every fish and fill out every page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To receive news and update notifications</strong><br>Please click on <strong>Developer: SAT-BOX</strong> at the top of the store page and <strong>Follow</strong> us!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650090?t=1773043029","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650090?t=1773043029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650090/61ea77247fe59d553c49a65ba85875131461647c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1